B.a8y=new A.fk("record","How do I record something?","The gold microphone button, from anywhere in the app. It starts a new song and goes straight into recording \u2014 no naming, no choosing where it lives. You can do both afterwards, once there is something worth filing.\n\nTo add a recording to a song you already have, open it and press Record on the toolbar.",B.aYM)
